  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Study your history—",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Whoever don't? I pity the fool like Mr. T",
          "rhyme": "t",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Knowledge this degree, it ain’t no mystery",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "\"What you gon' do\" or \"what you know\" is what is to see",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "(Ping) And that's more than meets the eyeball",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Now who wants to buy a brand new tsetse fly call?",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Alright y'all (pewm), the speed was break-neck",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Faster than the hi-speed, dual cassette tape deck",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "(How far?) The distance was light-speed",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "He went to see a buddy who said he had some white weed",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "In case he might need, it didn't mean much",
          "rhyme": "9tS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "For in his lean clutch was the elusive green Dutch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Who that? Kinga, Vaughn younger brother",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "A real live swinger who rock Louis Vuitton pleather",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "And he walk around like he think he king",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Even made the hood-rats stop to kiss his pinky ring",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Like a soup sandwich on a hand dish",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Some say his language was way too outlandish",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "He did his thing, then spoke in a jig-slang",
          "rhyme": "#g",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "And translate Einstein's theory of The Big Bang",
          "rhyme": "#g",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Told his boo, \"Boo, I put a spell on you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "And stay with me, whether we broke or we well-to-do",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "If it don't work, to hell with ya",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "May the doorknob hit ya where the poor slob bit ya\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "What you thought ya' darn skeezer?",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "The G of a mack and the steez of a geezer",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "A true man of leisure, she must've caught amnesia",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Paid off the 8th grade fade or a Caesar",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "He was known for his thick skin",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Part Zimbabwean and part Trini mixed in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Big shot, sold a guy a pound of pig snot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Said it was proven to remove stains and ink spots",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Kinky flow, dripped down her leg to her pinky toe",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Jinky ho, who don't know as much as she think she know",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "One wink she stepped to him like a Slinky, yo'",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Wig like a mink skin, soft like Twinkie dough",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Then he kissed the queen and told her she need Listerine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Twist the green, it's laced with antihistamine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Enough to make you make your face up like Mr. Bean",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "V hit the scene like, \"Fuck it, give me a Mr. Clean\"",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABAACCDDEEFGHHIIJJKKLMNNOONPQQMRSMMTQQQQ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABAACCDDAAEADDAAAAFFGCHHEEHHAACIACCIAAAA"
    },
    {
